==English==

===Etymology 1===
The letter name is ultimately from {{der|en|la|ē}}. Use of the Latin letter in (Old) English displaced, in whole or in part, five [[futhorc]] letters in the 7th century: {{m|ang|ᛖ}}, {{m|ang|ᚫ}}, {{m|ang|ᛠ}}, {{m|ang|ᛇ}}, and {{m|ang|ᛟ}}.

